OL,3,CWhat are the financial charges against
OL,4,CManchester City and why do they matter?
OL,6,FManchester City are found guilty of
OL,7,Fbreaching the Premier League's
OL,8,Ffinancial rules three and a half years
OL,9,Fafter the club was charged - but what
OL,10,Fare the charges?
OL,12,FThe charges cover a nine-year period
OL,13,Fbeginning in 2009.
OL,15,FCity were alleged to have breached
OL,16,Frules in every season up until 2017/
OL,17,F18, which require clubs to provide
OL,18,Faccurate financial information to give
OL,19,Fthe league a "true and fair view" of
OL,20,Fthe club's revenues, including
OL,21,Fsponsorships, and operating costs.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/8
