OL,3,CWhat are the financial charges against
OL,4,CManchester City and why do they matter?
OL,6,FThe Premier League also claimed the
OL,7,Fclub broke rules requiring them to
OL,8,Fcomply with UEFA's regulations for the
OL,9,Fseasons 2013/14 to 2017/18.
OL,11,FThe league says City did not cooperate
OL,12,Fwith them during the entirety of its
OL,13,Finvestigation, which began in 2018 -
OL,14,Ffailing to provide documents and
OL,15,Finformation.
OL,17,FCity were also charged with breaching
OL,18,Fthe Premier League's Profitability and
OL,19,FSustainability Rules (PSR) in the
OL,20,Fthree seasons between 2015 and 2018.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
