OL,3,CWhat are the financial charges against
OL,4,CManchester City and why do they matter?
OL,6,FThe charges also claim the club did
OL,7,Fnot fully disclose contracts detailing
OL,8,Fmanagerial remuneration from the
OL,9,Fseasons between 2009 and 2013, when
OL,10,FRoberto Mancini was in charge, and
OL,11,Fplayer compensation from the 2010 to
OL,12,Fthe 2016 campaigns.
OL,14,FWhat are Financial Fair Play rules?
OL,16,FFinancial Fair Play (FFP) rules are
OL,17,Fdesigned to stop clubs from spending
OL,18,Fmore than they earn.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
