OL,3,CWhat are the financial charges against
OL,4,CManchester City and why do they matter?
OL,6,FIt also helps prevent the wealthiest
OL,7,Fowners from signing the best players
OL,8,Fand, essentially, buying success.
OL,10,FWhat are Profitability and
OL,11,FSustainability Rules (PSR)?
OL,13,FThe Premier League's Profit and
OL,14,FSustainability Rules allow clubs to
OL,15,Flose no more than #105 million over
OL,16,Fthree seasons, or #35 million in a
OL,17,Fsingle season.
OL,19,FWhy do these charges matter?
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
