OL,3,CWhat are the financial charges against
OL,4,CManchester City and why do they matter?
OL,6,FAny repercussions on Manchester City,
OL,7,Fincluding relegation or stripping the
OL,8,Fclub of their titles, would ultimately
OL,9,Freflect badly on the Premier League.
OL,11,FIt has echoes of the Calciopoli
OL,12,Fscandal that rocked Italy's Serie A in
OL,13,F2006, which saw Juventus stripped of
OL,14,Ftwo league titles and demoted to the
OL,15,Fsecond tier.
OL,17,FHow did these charges come about?
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
