OL,3,CWhat are the financial charges against
OL,4,CManchester City and why do they matter?
OL,6,FPortuguese computer hacker Rui Pinto
OL,7,Fset up his Football Leaks website in
OL,8,FSeptember 2015, where he published a
OL,9,Fhost of private documents from the
OL,10,Fworld of football, including
OL,11,FManchester City.
OL,13,FJust a few months later, in November,
OL,14,FGerman newspaper Der Spiegel first
OL,15,Fwrote articles accusing City of
OL,16,Fbreaking financial rules.
OL,18,FIn February 2020 European football's
OL,19,Fgoverning body UEFA found City guilty
OL,20,Fof breaching Financial Fair Play rules
OL,21,Fby overstating sponsorship revenue.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
