OL,3,CWhat are the financial charges against
OL,4,CManchester City and why do they matter?
OL,6,FThey were given a two-year ban from
OL,7,Fall European competitions and fined
OL,8,Faround 25 million pounds.
OL,10,FBut City always denied any wrongdoing,
OL,11,Fand five months later won an appeal at
OL,12,Fthe Court of Arbitration for Sport.
OL,13,FThe ban was overturned and the fine
OL,14,Freduced.
OL,16,FBy that time though the Premier League
OL,17,Fwere also looking into their finances,
OL,18,Fand in February 2023 accused the
OL,19,FEnglish champions of more than one
OL,20,Fhundred allegations of breaking the
OL,21,FLeague's financial rules.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
