OL,3,CWhat are the financial charges against
OL,4,CManchester City and why do they matter?
OL,6,FCity again denied all the charges -
OL,7,Fwith the independent hearing starting
OL,8,F18 months later, in September 2024,
OL,9,Fdue of the complexity of the case.
OL,11,FIt lasted 12 weeks, ending in December
OL,12,F2024, before an outcome was finally
OL,13,Fgiven 21 months later in September
OL,14,F2026.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/8
